      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحقّق</span></b>  [<i>It was,</i> or <i>became,</i> or <i>proved to
be, a truth, a reality,</i> or <i>a fact.</i>] [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحقّق</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِنْدَهُ الخَبَرُ</span> <i>The information was,</i> or <i>proved,
